      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p><html:strong>Apple Vision OCR</html:strong>: Run VNRecognizeTextRequest on-device after save, store OCR text, bridge writes <![CDATA[\meta{ocr-text}]]> to the tree file. Enables full-text search of handwritten notes.</html:p>
        <html:p><html:strong>Flexible metadata/taxonomy</html:strong>: Remove hardcoded Handwriting taxon. Add a metadata editor panel in the app. Handwritten-ness should be a tag, not a taxon. Trees routing to PDFs should support arbitrary metadata, digital text, and mixed content.</html:p>
        <html:p><html:strong>Custom toolbar actions</html:strong>: Overlay forest-specific buttons alongside PencilKit toolbar (create todo, insert transclusion, set taxon). Equivalent to Emacs forest functions but for touch.</html:p>
