              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>Four signed <html:code>.shortcut</html:code> files in <html:code>~/forest/utils/shortcuts/</html:code>, generated by <html:code>gen-capture-shortcuts.py</html:code> and signed with <html:code>shortcuts sign --mode anyone</html:code> for distribution to iPad/iPhone without the removed "Allow Untrusted Shortcuts" toggle.</html:p>
